"01e97107b60b95931ebcfc60070169527aa7df84": {"body":"GitHub Actions created runs 1500 to 1523 (from 20:17:15 UTC) but never their\njobs; runs resumed with 1525 at 21:02:28. No deploy from 20:13:47 (run 1499)\nto 21:02:53 (run 1525): 49 min. Longest push to served 45 min 38 s. No run\nfailed; 8 were replaced by newer pushes, as usual; normal again from run 1537.\nv0.1.1545 (dev's head) is served; eda47148 was run 1531 (served 21:07:55).\nThe 24 held runs are still queued at 21:19. If GitHub ever starts one, it would\ndeploy that older commit over the newest: ci/patches/deploy-newest-only.patch\nmakes a run whose commit is no longer dev's head build and gate but not deploy.\nThe record is in agents/ci/status.json (stall_2026_11_11), for the library.","session":"session_018yvwtLVQXvckk4k5VQ1eEk","files":[{"p":"accounts/ledger/ci.jsonl","a":1,"d":0},{"p":"agents/ci/status.json","a":20,"d":4},{"p":"ci/patches/README.md","a":2,"d":1},{"p":"ci/patches/deploy-newest-only.patch","a":46,"d":0},{"p":"data/ci/commits/2026-11-11T20.json","a":1316,"d":3},{"p":"data/ci/commits/2026-11-11T21.json","a":911,"d":0},{"p":"data/ci/index.json","a":557,"d":508},{"p":"data/ci/runs/2026-11-11T20.json","a":508,"d":2},{"p":"data/ci/runs/2026-11-11T21.json","a":1120,"d":0},{"p":"data/ci/tree.json","a":397,"d":397}],"more_files":0},
